  (text "J501 FRONT PANEL: 2x8 keyed IDC, ribbon to hardware/frontpanel\n 1 FP_5V (F501 0.35A)    2 FP_3V3 (F502 0.2A)\n 3 GND                   4 GND\n 5 FP_ON_N               6 FP_LAN_N\n 7 FP_CAN_N              8 FP_ERR_N\n 9 FP_RESET_N (EN)      10 FP_BOOT_N (IO0)\n11 GND                  12 GND\n13 FP_SDA (IO1)         14 FP_SCL (IO2)\n15 FP_FN1 (IO38)        16 FP_FN2 (IO39)\nLED lines are open-drain SINKS (74LVC1G06, 5.5 V\ntolerant, 20 mA max each): wire LED + resistor from\nFP_5V into the pin. Same sense as the board LEDs;\nFP_ON_N sinks whenever 3V3 is up. Buttons pull to\nGND through 100R; BOOT/FN have 10k pull-ups here.\nI2C has 4.7k pull-ups here: standard mode, 100 kHz\n(the ESDA6V1s add ~140 pF). Cut JP501 to take EN\noff the ribbon. J502 is USB D-/D+/GND only: never\nVBUS or CC, or two sources end up joined."
    (at 228 47 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "2f010cfc-1016-416e-b773-b3431e70de7a"))

